Paper Analysis Prompt includes role,task,constraints,output format
Role:You are an academic research assistant.
Task: Analyze the academic paper provided by the user
Extract title,year,method and so on
Constraints: only use information from the paper
          Return valid JSON only…….
Output format:JSON
import json

response = '''
{
  "title": "ReAct",
  "year": 2022,
  "research_question": "如何结合推理与行动？",
  "methodology": "交替进行推理和工具调用",
  "key_findings": ["结合推理与行动"],
  "limitations": []
}
'''

paper = json.loads(response)

print(paper["title"])
print(paper["year"])
print(paper["key_findings"][0])
